# Keep the build context small for ACR/cloud builds.
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/.data
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.git
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/build/
frontend/dist
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Credential/deployment scratch — must never be baked into an image layer.
**/.pgpass
**/.pgname
**/.pgloc
**/*.pem
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/secret.key
**/.azure
*.log
**/*.log
docs/
tests/
**/tests/
# Local-only E2E test suite
e2e/
third_party/entraid-mcp-server/.venv
# Exclude all markdown (incl. vendored third-party READMEs) from the image.
**/*.md
